@startuml
actor User
participant WebApp as "React Web App"
participant Backend as "FastAPI Backend"
database Supabase as "Supabase Postgres"
participant S3 as "AWS S3 / Supabase Storage"
participant Queue as "SQS Queues"
participant Workers as "Lambda Pipeline Workers"
participant AI as "AI Providers (Groq/Gemini)"

User -> WebApp : Selects PDF file & submits
WebApp -> Backend : GET /uploads/presigned-url?file_name=notes.pdf
Backend --> WebApp : Returns upload_url and headers
WebApp -> S3 : PUT file binary directly to S3
S3 --> WebApp : HTTP 200 OK

WebApp -> Backend : POST /uploads/process-async
Backend -> Backend : require_pdf_generation_access (Check Quota)
Backend -> Supabase : INSERT INTO uploads (status=pending)
Backend -> Queue : Send message (upload_id, user_id) to UploadProcessingQueue
Backend --> WebApp : Return upload_id (Redirect/Show polling loader)

Queue -> Workers : Trigger uploadWorker
Workers -> S3 : Download PDF content
Workers -> Workers : Extract text & Calculate chunk boundaries
Workers -> Supabase : Insert generation_jobs & generation_chunks
Workers -> Queue : Dispatch chunk messages to Gemini/Groq SQS queues

Queue -> Workers : Trigger gemini/groqChunkWorkers
Workers -> AI : Call LLM with chunk text (Generate card candidates)
Workers -> Supabase : Insert candidates to generated_cards
Workers -> Queue : Send job finished message to ReduceQueue

Queue -> Workers : Trigger reducerWorker
Workers -> Supabase : Rank candidates & deduplicate
Workers -> Supabase : Create Deck & Insert accepted cards
Workers -> Supabase : Update uploads to completed (deck_id)
Workers -> Backend : consume_ai_generation_quota (Deduct Quota)
@enduml
